WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.731
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: Which word describes the

00:00:04.731 --> 00:00:05.939
length of a rope?

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:09.877
The answer is: long. Long is a length adjective.

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:15.415
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which word describes the

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:16.650
height of a tree?

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.031
The answer is: tall. Tall describes height.
